  "content": "Содержание посвящено модам, ресурс-пакам, модпакам, шейдер-пакам или другим ресурсам, связанным с Minecraft. Пожалуйста, сохраняйте стиль языка приятным для геймеров.<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Diagonal Fences делает все виды заборов способными соединяться по диагонали. Работает так, как вы и ожидаете, поэтому особо нечего добавлять.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Блоки, добавленные другими модами, динамически поддерживаются, когда это возможно. Блоки, которые непреднамеренно подвергаются воздействию, можно предотвратить от этого, добавив их в тег </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">diagonalfences:non_diagonal_fences</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> блока.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Посмотрите два других проекта из семейства модов для диагональных блоков: </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-windows\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Diagonal Windows</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">и </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-walls\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Diagonal Walls</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Работает отлично в сочетании с модами, такими как </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayson-furniture-mod\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MrCrayon's Furniture Mod</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> от </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/users/mrcrayon\">MrCrayon</a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">on</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">'s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"ont-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">s</span><span style=\"font:14px;\">s</span><span style=\"14px;\">s</span><span style=\"14px;\">